- Supporting evidence.
- Explanation of the issue.
- Severity level.
- Suggested correction.

The system provides decision support and does not independently guarantee legal or regulatory compliance.

## 13. Security Considerations

- Use separate User and Admin access.
- Protect administrator operations.
- Store secrets in environment variables.
- Do not upload passwords or API keys to GitHub.
- Exclude local databases and private user data from public repositories.
- Use secure authentication and HTTPS in production.

